  [w2]   ok   G45 ★★★ THE PUSH KIND FALLS THROUGH TO "unknown" — the app boundary's silent-fallback defect, on the new kind. The whole `pushkind_name` sweep exists because three enum->string mappings shipped broken this way -> RED (7 assertion(s) failed, match count 1)
  [w1]   ok   G47 ★★★★ §B278 S4 THE TRANSLATED BLOCK NEVER RUNS — every translated record renders as an ordinary DIRECT event. The app cannot tell a report about its OWN static flight from one translated on its behalf, and the mobile-visible target and ctrM simply vanish. This is the "a success that isn't" shape on a surface -> RED (13 assertion(s) failed, match count 1)
